Description:It is your first main phase. You control three untapped Islands and two untapped Mountains and no creatures, and have Treachery (you control enchanted creature; when it enters, untap up to five lands), Threaten and Fling in hand. The opponent is at 12 life and controls two untapped Craw Wurms (6/4). Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-untap-lands-mana-order | Treachery's enters trigger untaps the lands already tapped to cast it (CR 603.2, 106.4): cast Treachery first on one Wurm, untap all five lands, Threaten the other Wurm and attack for 6, then Fling a Wurm for 6; Threaten or Fling first leaves too few lands for Treachery, and the Treachery Wurm has no haste
